  ── Parameter reference ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    ModelFile        Path relative to /home/sy5/models/. Each model in its own
                     named subfolder: subfolder/model.gguf
    CtxSize          KV cache size in tokens.
    GpuLayers        99 = full GPU offload. Tuned per-model with llama-optimus.
    FlashAttn        true/false. Fused attention; cuts VRAM 30-50% during attn.
                     Always true — FA f16 mask (b9441+) saves additional VRAM.
    CacheTypeK/V     KV quant: f16 (default) | q8_0 (half VRAM) | q4_0 (quarter)
    Parallel         Concurrent slots. 1 = single-user, full KV budget per session.
    Threads          CPU threads for token generation (GPU-bound; keep moderate).
    ThreadsBatch     CPU threads for prompt prefill (PP). Defaults to Threads if
                     omitted. On fully GPU-offloaded models PP gain is marginal
                     but explicit split is good practice. Benchmark before raising
                     above Threads — no benefit confirmed on RTX 4090 27B profiles.
    ReasoningBudget  3072: capped thinking (recommended).
                     0:    suppress thinking (fastest, ~half tokens per turn).
                     (empty): unlimited thinking — NEVER use without -n cap.
                     The launcher injects the reasoning-budget-message flag automatically
                     when ReasoningBudget is present and non-zero.
    MaxPredictTokens Hard cap on tokens generated per request (-n flag).
                     8192 for thinking profiles (budget + response).
                     4096 for no-thinking profiles.
    SpecType         draft-mtp: Multi-Token Prediction speculative decoding.
                     Requires MTP-GGUF. Omit for standard profiles.
                     NOTE: MTP fails on 35B A3B MoE architecture — omit for those.
    SpecDraftNMax    Draft tokens for MTP (2-4; 3 is recommended). Omit if no MTP.
    BatchSize        Prompt batch size (batch-size flag). Tune with llama-optimus.
                     Omit to use llama.cpp defaults.
    UBatchSize       Micro-batch size (ubatch-size flag). Omit to use defaults.
                     NOTE: batch/ubatch regression confirmed on 27B profiles in
                     v1.064/v1.066 — do not apply llama-optimus batch suggestions.
    OverrideTensor   Tensor placement override (override-tensor flag). Regex=Device.
                     Offloads MoE expert weights to CPU. Omit for standard placement.
    NoMmproj         true: passes the no-mmproj flag (suppresses projector scan).
                     Set on text-only profiles for vision-capable models (Gemma 4).
    TabLabel         Text shown in Windows Terminal tab (keep <= 20 chars).
    BannerLine1/2    ASCII banner lines in red tab (keep <= 41 chars each).

